, here to provide you with high-quality and reliable trading services!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Greetings. I do apologize for the intrusion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"May I enquire if this is the headquarters of the Fox Sisterhood?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_CZ52","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,170"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sophia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Greetings. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, Your Grace. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the office of Miss Catherine Ponzi, Director of the Fox Sisterhood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please don't stand on such ceremony. Her Majesty has stripped me of my dukedom. You may simply call me Louis Hume."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_CZ52","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,170"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sophia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Yes, sir. Please follow me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who is he? He sounds so fancy-schmancy.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That's your Mother.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? He's Arthur Hume?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Don't you recognize him?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...To be honest, his face was never visible in al