 is the younger Ponzi sister in the Fox Sisterhood. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The train we saw was probably the Casino Train, which would place us at around the 30s."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Was the Doctor going by the name Louis Hume back then? Did he have any dealings with the Fox Sisterhood? I don't remember this at all."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe it wasn't him at all? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Could it be, say... Mother's father?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm not even going to try to make sense of that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still... it's true that we have no information about the Doctor's father, so we can't rule out that possibility."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I just searched through your anchor points. \"Louis Hume\", \"Catherine Ponzi\", \"Maggie Ponzi\", \"Sophia\"... None of these came up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":15,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then our only trail goes cold..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on. This Louis Hume said he was stripped of his title by the King, right? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Didn't Mirabelle say the King had put a bounty on Archbishop Hume's head?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...If that had already happened by this point in time, it'd make no sense for us to search the train. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've got to be missing something... I need to rewatch this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":13,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two Dolls return to the anchor point named \"Colt Express\". "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The same conversation takes place in the same setting again... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Erma remains just as mystified, but Reinette manages to glean plenty of new insight from the replay."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've figured it out..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? Figured out what?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unicorn... \"A horn of hope to pierce through this Collapse miasma.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This isn't the Casino Train... It's the Horn of Hope!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not stopping to elaborate, Reinette punches in the parameter for another search."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_2023Slow_Keyboard_Correct","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Searching... Unicorn—got it! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Come on, access the anchor point!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":14,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Fine. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You sure are brimming with motivation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I have a feeling you'd get on swell with AR-18."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...There are two of us here, but only one of us has brains."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_magic_circle_start","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"697","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Upon entering the anchor point named \"Unicorn\", their view becomes much less restricted. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even under the dim light, they can see the extraordinarily rich textures in the lavishly decorated interior. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A skimpily dressed woman is sitting on top of an ornate solid wood desk in the center of the room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_4","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't be so hasty in your rejection, Mr. Hume. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Project \"Horn of Hope\" aims to help more people."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is an utter scam, Miss Ponzi."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How do you define a scam? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Before Franklin discovered electricity, things like motorcars were considered a scam. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Bloodletting had also been a popular remedy for centuries before the advent of modern medicine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Franklin merely demonstrated the connection between electricity and lightning. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He didn't technically \"discover\" electricity."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fair enough, my wording was a bit off. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But you get my point. Like the examples I just gave, Project \"Horn of Hope\" is full of potential even if it may not be apparent in the present."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You are testing my patience, Miss Ponzi. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Calling your project a scam is already putting it mildly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With a single drop of blood, one can obtain their own genetic sequence and receive personal medical advice. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They are then given a \"Horn of Hope\", which would allegedly boost their resistance to Collapse radiation and improve their immune system and general health. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Forgive me, but anyone with even just a little medical common sense would not believe such drivel."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie Ponzi grins as she gives Hume an approving look."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah yes, the self-confidence. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Mr. Hume, with your face and your poise, it's a massive waste of talent that you're not in the business of conning people."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Ponzi, I shall refrain from making further comments as a courtesy to you as a lady. Please take your leave. Our conversation tonight is over."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My, my, don't get prissy with me! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're an engineer; I'm also an engineer. Why must we engineers make each other's life difficult?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pardon me for being blunt, but I could not detect a single shred of professional knowledge in any scientific discipline from what you said. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even a graduate fresh out of university would not propose such an inane project."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk, you think I don't know anything about science?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}},{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That is quite obvious."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, I say you don't know anything about society! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And this happens to be my forte. I am the most outstanding social engineer in the whole wide world! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why do you think I'm laying it on so thick? Because this is the kind of language that the general public and the investors would understand! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or should I be throwing out professional jargon like you Doll engineers? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm starting to wonder how you managed to con your investors into giving you a billion for your Project Pilot Whale!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Erma."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? I didn't say anything!","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Have you taken a good look around the room? There are more than ten people in here.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma scans her surroundings. They appear to be in Hume's sitting room. Maggie has taken over his desk and is surrounded by a dozen girls or Dolls dressed in medical uniforms. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, Louis Hume only has Erma and Stevens M520 standing next to him."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry, I was completely distracted by Maggie's outfit...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Haven't you noticed that we've been watching from our own bodies in this time frame all this while?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't remember this ever happening.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Me neither... I'm guessing this is an earlier iteration of us.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What should I do then?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Hume","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Louis Hume","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Look up the definition of \"social engineer\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There is no clear definition of \"social engineer\", but I did find the source of the term \"social engineering\". It's from \"The Art of Deception\" by a famous hacker called Kevin Mitnick. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Going by the book's explanation, you can think of a social engineer as someone who exploits people's psychological weaknesses as well as loopholes in rules and systems. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By establishing trust and rapport with the victim, they obtain valuable information and ultimately gain access to certain sensitive and private data through unauthorized channels."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So in simple terms, a social engineer is a scammer."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Louis Hume purses his lips. He is so enraged he is at a loss for words."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He storms out of the room in silence."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bam—the door slams shut. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It kicks up a puff of dust."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The Doctor has put an end to the conversation. You should leave."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_4","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But then he started talking to me again. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I haven't achieved my aim yet, so why should I go?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I have a feeling this is the only woman who can make you eat dirt.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,60","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shut up!!!","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Because this is our place!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh? But we're in wartime."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you getting at?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's the point of rules when the world is upside down? All I care about is doing what I want to do, and doing it well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why, you!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now be a good girl and tell me where he's stormed off to. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm going after him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Erma! Draw your weapon!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm! Throwing! This! Bitch! Out!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie Ponzi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tut-tut. Are the local gangs so bad-mannered?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie snickers at the guns which are poised to blow her head off. She beckons leisurely at the Dolls behind her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
